io. Sin ella, buscar un elemento en una lista enlazada tomar\u00eda $O(n)$.\n\n2.  **Lista Doblemente Enlazada (Doubly Linked List):**\n    *   **Funci\u00f3n:**", "id": "overlap-v1-spanish-1536-mtp-r1", "case_id": "spanish-1536", "method": "mtp", "warmup": false, "max_tokens": 256, "prefill_mode": "overlap", "source_request_id": "spanish-1536-mtp-r1", "repeat": 9, "sample_repeat": 1, "eval_group_size": 32, "prompt_sha256": "57de44befcdd34804972ef4ecafae976f46b34a965b0c7d657db69bb902fca51", "prompt_token_ids": [248045, 846, 198, 760, 2614, 26388, 14246, 17593, 369, 3870, 1132, 13, 21134, 279, 41559, 1238, 424, 26, 635, 524, 59987, 466, 2880, 279, 17593, 13, 198, 27, 15547, 29, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 15, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 15, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 16, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 16, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 17, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 17, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 18, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 18, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 19, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 19, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 20, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 20, 26, 424, 12076, 264, 25293, 9463, 1518, 58565, 279, 1622, 13, 1061, 3150, 369, 3870, 2193, 11, 524, 449, 7359, 13, 198, 41089, 3150, 220, 15, 15, 15, 21, 25, 264, 11525, 3816, 2531, 12, 15, 15, 15, 21, 26, 424, 12076,